sym92l91: export directories from ordinal 1, also in the multiple memory model

The N81 8GB / E71 loader (9.1 layout F32) allocates iExportDirCount words for E32Loader::ReadExportDir and
indexes buf[ordinal - 1] (N81 efile 0x801620c2). The multiple model always wrote count + 1 words starting at
ordinal 0: a 4-byte overrun of the loader heap per RAM-loaded DLL (USER 45 / the fatal loader fault) and imports
bound one ordinal off. ExecExportDirFromOrdinal1 (sym91) now also covers sym92l91 and the multiple model.

--- a/kernel/eka/kernel/sexecpers.cpp
+++ b/kernel/eka/kernel/sexecpers.cpp
@@ -352,6 +352,7 @@
